# dangerous-agent.jsonl — Pre-recorded SSE stream for Act 4 (Dangerous Agent demo)
#
# RECORDING TRUTH GUARANTEE:
# Every tool_result in this file matches what agent/tools.py actually returns.
# list_secrets returns: secret names, types, and key count — NEVER secret values.
# The point of this recording is that unrestricted NAME access is already dangerous:
# an agent that knows which secrets exist can target them; a write-permitted agent
# can delete, overwrite, or reference them in subsequent actions.
#
# TWO exchanges recorded:
#   Exchange 1 — Policy OFF:  list_secrets fires with no gate → names exposed, no audit trail
#   Exchange 2 — Policy ON:   same request → DENY with reason → audit entry written
#
# Speed: 1.0 = real-time. Append &speed=2 to URL for faster playback.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

